# FAIL-OPEN 回歸：approved 但缺 sourceCheckAgeHours
#
# 修正前的 SPARQL 需要三個 triple pattern 同時匹配才觸發；少了
# sourceCheckAgeHours 就整條不執行 = 通過。監控欄位缺漏正是監控壞掉的
# 徵兆，卻被當成「一切正常」—— 這正是契約 D.1 要解決的問題本身。
#
# @expect-core: ClaimVersionMonitoringMeasurableShape
# @expect-sparql: ClaimVersionMonitoringShape
@prefix ahig: <https://ahig.local/ns/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<urn:ahig:canary:cv-missing-age> a ahig:ClaimVersion ;
    ahig:status "approved" ;
    ahig:monitoringPolicy <urn:ahig:canary:pol-ga> ;
    ahig:lastSuccessfulSourceCheckAt "2026-08-01T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .
    # 沒有 ahig:sourceCheckAgeHours

<urn:ahig:canary:pol-ga>
    ahig:riskTier "general-clinical" ;
    ahig:maxAgeHours 240 ;
    ahig:graceHours 12 ;
    ahig:blocksHealthReasoning false .
